        "objective": "Master Rioplatense spatial orientation and distance measurements (a tantas cuadras, a la vuelta, al lado de, enfrente de, re cerca, re lejos de, entre).",
        "presentation": {
            "explanation": "In Argentina, distances and urban orientations are measured in **cuadras** (city blocks) and framed with Rioplatense spatial markers:\n\n1. The Argentine City Block Metric (**LA CUADRA**):\n   - Buenos Aires is designed as a classic Spanish grid (*damero*), where each block is exactly **100 meters** = **una cuadra**.\n   - **a una cuadra** = one block away (~100m)\n   - **a dos cuadras de...** = two blocks away from...\n   - **a media cuadra** = half a block away (~50m)\n   - **a la vuelta** = around the corner (literally on the same block, just around the corner!)\n\n2. Spatial Positions & Rioplatense Boosters (**RE-**):\n   - **re cerca (de)** = super close / right nearby\n   - **re lejos (de)** = super far away\n   - **al lado de** = next to / right beside (*al lado del kiosco*)\n   - **enfrente de / frente a** = across from / opposite (*enfrente de la plaza*)\n   - **entre** = between (*entre Corrientes y Lavalle*)\n   - **en la esquina de** = at the corner of (*en la esquina de Corrientes y Callao*).",
            "examples": [
                {
                    "target": "La pizzería Guerrín está a dos cuadras del Obelisco, sobre la calle Corrientes.",
                    "reading": "La pizzería Guerrín está a dos cuadras del Obelisco, sobre la calle Corrientes.",
                    "translation": "Guerrín Pizzeria is two blocks from the Obelisk, on Corrientes Street."
                },
                {
                    "target": "El banco está a la vuelta, al lado de la farmacia.",
                    "reading": "El banco está a la vuelta, al lado de la farmacia.",
                    "translation": "The bank is around the corner, next to the pharmacy."
                },
                {
                    "target": "San Telmo queda re cerca de la Plaza de Mayo, son diez cuadras caminando.",
                    "reading": "San Telmo queda re cerca de la Plaza de Mayo, son diez cuadras caminando.",
                    "translation": "San Telmo is super close to Plaza de Mayo, it's ten blocks walking."
                }
            ],
            "mnemonics": [
                "A TANTAS CUADRAS = How many blocks away!",
                "A LA VUELTA = Around the corner!",
                "RE CERCA = Super close; RE LEJOS = Super far!"
            ],
            "culturalNotes": [
                "In Buenos Aires, house numbers reflect the block distance: 1450 Avenida Corrientes is exactly 14 and a half blocks from the start of the avenue (each block advances the numbering by 100)."
            ]
        },
